## Service Networks

Service networks schema for validation.

---

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft-2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Service Networks",
  "type": "array",
  "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Unique identifier for the service network.",
        "example": "example.com"
      },
      "description": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Service network description.",
        "example": "Example service network"
      },
      "sources": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Source identifiers (e.g., sources.json).",
          "example": "example.com"
        }
      },
      "format": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Format of the service network (e.g., cidr-lines, ripe-ris-prefixes).",
        "example": "cidr-lines"
      },
      "identity_source": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Identity source for the service network.",
        "example": "example.com"
      }
    },
    "required": ["id", "description", "sources", "format", "identity_source"]
  }
}
```